config DEFY_STUDIO_USB_PRIORITY
    bool "Keep Studio on an available USB connection"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_STUDIO_TRANSPORT_UART && (ZMK_USB || ARCH_POSIX)
    help
      Lets Studio work over USB whichever output carries the keys. While a
      USB host is ready, Studio's RPC sees USB as the selected endpoint, and
      a Bluetooth Studio disconnect does not lock Studio. Key reports keep
      the selected output.
